      "taskType": "procedural",
      "prompt": "Subtract $({{a}}+({{b}})i)-({{a}}+({{d}})i)$. Distribute the subtraction, determine the real and imaginary components, and write the result in simplified standard form. This family deliberately allows the real component to cancel completely.",
      "stimulus": {
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "Component bookkeeping",
        "table": {
          "headers": [
            "Component",
            "First number",
            "Subtract second number"
