          "So the result is purely imaginary: {{im}}i."
        ],
        "answerSummary": "${{im}}i$"
      },
      "attemptFeedback": [
        "Distribute the subtraction to the real and imaginary parts of the second complex number."
      ],
      "supportHints": [
        "The real components are identical, so focus carefully on the imaginary-coefficient subtraction."
