      "taskType": "procedural",
      "prompt": "Multiply $({{a}}+({{b}})i)({{c}}+({{d}})i)$. Use $i^2=-1$, determine the final real part and imaginary coefficient, and write the product in standard $a+bi$ form.",
      "stimulus": {
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "FOIL structure",
        "table": {
          "headers": [
            "Contribution",
            "Expression"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "real from ac",
              "{{a}}·{{c}}"
            ],
            [
              "imaginary from ad",
              "{{a}}·{{d}}i"
            ],
            [
              "imaginary from bc",
              "{{b}}·{{c}}i"
            ],
            [
              "i² term",
              "{{b}}·{{d}}i²"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "responseFields": [
        {
          "id": "real-part",
          "label": "Final real part after using i²=-1",
          "inputProfile": "number",
          "expected": "{{re}}"
        },
        {
          "id": "imag-coefficient",
          "label": "Final imaginary coefficient",
          "inputProfile": "number",
          "expected": "{{im}}"
        },
        {
          "id": "answer",
          "label": "Simplified product",
          "inputProfile": "expression",
          "expected": "{{re}}+({{im}})*i"
        }
      ],
      "solutionReview": {
        "headline": "FOIL, replace i² with -1, then combine components.",
        "reasoning": [
          "The real part is ac-bd={{a}}({{c}})-{{b}}({{d}})={{re}}.",
          "The imaginary coefficient is ad+bc={{a}}({{d}})+{{b}}({{c}})={{im}}.",
          "The simplified product is {{re}}+({{im}})i."
        ],
        "answerSummary": "${{re}}+({{im}})i$"
      },
      "attemptFeedback": [
        "The bd·i² term contributes -bd to the real part because i²=-1."
      ],
      "supportHints": [
        "After FOIL, group the terms without i and the terms with exactly one i."
      ],
      "generator": {
        "parameters": {
          "a": {
            "type": "int",
            "min": -6,
            "max": 6,
            "exclude": [
              0
            ]
          },
          "b": {
            "type": "int",
            "min": -6,
            "max": 6,
            "exclude": [
              0
            ]
          },
          "c": {
            "type": "int",
            "min": -6,
            "max": 6,
            "exclude": [
              0
            ]
          },
          "d": {
            "type": "int",
            "min": -6,
            "max": 6,
            "exclude": [
              0
            ]
          }
        },
        "derived": {
          "re": "a*c-b*d",
          "im": "a*d+b*c"
        },
        "constraints": [
          "re!=0",
          "im!=0"
        ]
      }
