        }
      ],
      "solutionReview": {
        "headline": "The defining identity i²=-1 changes the real contribution of the last FOIL term.",
        "reasoning": [
          "The student used +bd instead of -bd in the real part.",
          "The correct real part is ac-bd={{re}}.",
          "The imaginary coefficient is ad+bc={{im}}, so the product is {{re}}+({{im}})i."
